  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Roll out the puff pastry and cut into a square.",
    "In a bowl, mix bell peppers, vegetables, shallots, and brown sugar.",
    "Arrange the mixture on one half of the pastry square, leaving a 1/2-inch border.",
    "Dot the top with butter and sprinkle with salt.",
    "Fold the other half of the pastry over the filling and press edges to seal.",
    "Brush the pastry with water and cut a few slits in the top.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Let cool for 10 minutes before serving."
